# JOURNEY · feeding for money: the player sees how far food has taken each fish (the Fed gauge).
# A bought fish starts at its catch weight, so it reads 0% until it eats; the sell list shows a Fed
# column beside the price whenever it holds a fish, and /show says what the fish is worth full.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
include scenes/buy-a-fish.play Merluza Ann
run /shop
key down
key enter
expect Fed
expect Ann (Merluza)
expect 0%
snap the sell list shows how fed every fish is
key esc
key esc
absent Fed

run /feed
tick 300
run /show "Ann"
expect FishResource#show
snap Ann after a portion of food
key esc
absent FishResource#show
